+# Include-root routes
+
+Outline r1, 2026-11-21, from [issue #217](https://github.com/vasiloglou/gnd-public/issues/217)
+and item 1 of [issue #214](https://github.com/vasiloglou/gnd-public/issues/214).
+Not reviewed and not approved.
+
+| Phase | Deliverable |
+|---|---|
+| IR1 | `gnd judgments check` judges a version-5 include root directly |
+| IR2 | A recorded flattening route that accepts temporal models |
+| IR3 | `gnd export pyrel` (both modes) accepts an include root through its recorded flattened model |
+
+[Plan outline](notes/include-root-routes-plan.md). It is first in the
+[roadmap after 0.4.0](../../PROJECT.md#roadmap-after-040--planned-2026-11-21):
+#217 has no workaround today.
